    'Browser SVG cleanup trades completeness for instant feedback. Use this checklist before you ship assets.',
  tool_svg_optimizer_rules_item_1: 'Comments and editor namespaces are safe to drop for production icons — they rarely affect rendering.',
  tool_svg_optimizer_rules_item_2: 'Rounding coordinates can shrink paths but may shift sub-pixel strokes — preview before you commit.',
